..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : EDIGA.BSTART.BA
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Functionality  : Start button "after". 
..                  This efop is run after an AJO-program filled the line zoom
..                  with detail information from single credit note edi messages.
..                  The row efop 'M|tab' fills the table with critical information,
..                  it can also be used to add error messages to the text field
..                  in the 2nd register of the line zoom.
..*****************************************************************************
..!meta M|=dfue/EDIGA
.set trans -
.. 
.. Set colours
.input "is/ABASFARBEN.DEF"
..
.select screen header
!NEXT
.select screen line
.continue END ? _G|mehr
.input 'M|tab'
.continue NEXT
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
